# 2026-11-19 owner OK ("rob kolejne testy na 7900xtx"). K-125 rerun: KLD kvq vs stock kernel (the first run had the switch
# inverted: ggml_cuda_env_switch is on when unset, so both arms ran without kvq). Then K-001 instrumented, then :8080 back.
k125-ref|900|~/qwen-opt/k125|./k125.sh ref
